      "category": "transfer",
      "prompt": "Lines p and q cut by transversal t. ∠3 and ∠6 are co-interior. ∠3 = (3x + 20)°, ∠6 = (5x − 4)°. Find the value of x that makes p ∥ q.",
      "answer": 20.5,
      "tolerance": 0.05,
      "explanation": "Set co-interior sum to 180°: (3x + 20) + (5x − 4) = 180 ⇒ 8x + 16 = 180 ⇒ x = 20.5.",
